{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261123/photo/bkn-20261123110741072-1123_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261123115315\"/><p>巴士車窗爆裂。(吳鎮興攝)</p><p>荃灣發生交通意外。今日(23)早上10時51分，一輛九巴沿沙咀道行駛，至近名逸居對開時一輛泊路旁貨車突然開門，巴士車窗被撞爆，一名女乘客被玻璃碎濺傷。救援人員接報到場替傷者治理後拒絕送院，兩車司機助查意外原因。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T04:09:29.027921+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T03:07:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T06:24:34.199235+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T04:03:04.969203+00:00","content_hash":"5a5826a6f01ef80655171393321aacb77ad27a9e3b871c8130339b7ab442a537","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T04:09:29.027921+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}